{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","裂爆屠戮"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","高举战斧砸向敌人，对目标及周围敌人造成伤害并回复自身。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一名敌人为目标，喀尔马高举战斧砸向目标，对目标造成400% + 40% ATK的伤害以及2.5秒眩晕。1秒后，战斧砸下位置产生半径1格的爆炸，对敌人造成400% + 50% ATK的基础伤害并外加上次施放该技能后喀尔马受到治疗效果总和40%的额外伤害，额外伤害至多不超过自身500% ATK，爆炸每命中一个非召唤物敌人都会恢复自身10% HP的生命值，并且战斗中每死亡一名非召唤物敌人都会使该效果额外回复等量的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":37,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":82,"end":88,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":27,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":78,"end":92,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":139,"end":147,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":167,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至420% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至11%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至440% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至12%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至460% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至13%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","爆炸造成的基础伤害提升至500% + 50% ATK，命中敌人为自身回复最大生命值的比例提升至15%。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","狂斧毒宴"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","在当前位置留下药池为自身提供回复，并挥动战斧劈砍周围敌人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔使用大量亡灵药剂沐浴全身，原地留下一滩持续6秒，半径1格的药剂池。药剂池每秒会对范围内的敌人造成100% + 10% ATK的伤害，并为喀尔马回复140% + 20% ATK的生命值。同时马尔挥动战斧，对周围的敌人造成300% + 30% ATK的伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":79,"end":85,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":75,"end":89,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒为自身回复的生命值提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒为自身回复的生命值提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每秒为自身回复的生命值提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","亢奋杀心"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","获得持续的生命回复，并挥舞战斧连续劈砍面前的敌人。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔喝下药剂，使自身每秒回复20%最大生命值，持续5秒。随后马尔快速挥动战斧，对半径1格扇形范围内德敌人造成3次劈砍，每次造成140% + 20% ATK的伤害，最后一击还会将目标击倒，使其倒地2秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":73,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至160% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至180% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次劈砍造成的伤害提升至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得11点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得15点受愈。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，喀尔马获得19点受愈。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","血怒杀意"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到治疗后会提升自身最大生命值，并为自身提供额外的护甲魔抗与韧性。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔马的肉体每次受到治愈都会变得更加强大，每受到自身初始最大生命值35%的治疗量可以使当前最大生命值增加40%，最多因此提升200%，并使自身体型略微增大。满层后自身额外提高60%护甲与魔抗和50点韧性，并使“裂爆屠戮”，“狂斧毒宴”，“亢奋杀心”的伤害范围增加一格。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","最大生命值的增加比例提升至45%，该效果的上限提升至225%，满层后自身额外提高70%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","来自该技能的最大生命值提升至上限后，喀尔马会永久处于稳定状态，并且技能“狂斧毒宴”、“亢奋杀心”中战斧的攻击命中敌人时会附带15% HP的魔法伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":62,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","最大生命值的增加比例提升至50%，上限提升至250%，满层后获得80%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","受到药水影响后降低受到的伤害。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","喀尔马受到自身药水的影响期间，受到的伤害降低50%。该效果无法叠加。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","双颅战斧"]]}